<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 3: </span>Statistics of large reasoning models. Models are categorized by their test-time scaling approach: effort-based (adjustable reasoning levels), and mode-based (thinking mode switching).</figcaption>
</figure>
<figure id="A6.T4" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A6.T4.2" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_align_middle">
<tr id="A6.T4.2.1" class="ltx_tr">
